  "title": "National Grid to Sponsor Fire, Rescue, EMS and Armed Forces Days at the 2026 New York State Fair",
  "summary": "In celebration of Fire, Rescue and EMS Day on Tuesday, Sept. 1, all active or retired members of a fire department, emergency services or EMS organization will receive free admission when presenting a photo ID from the department they serve or served, courtesy of National Grid.Active duty or veteran members of the military will receive free admission on Thursday, Sept. 3 for Armed Forces Day by presenting a valid military identification card, DD-214 form, or state-issued photo identification card with a veteran designation.",
